OPENAI_API_KEY=your-key-here
BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
SYSTEM_PROMPT=Given a short claim or headline, respond in 2-3 sentences: (1) is this the kind of claim that is easily verifiable, exaggerated, or opinion framed as fact, and (2) what additional context would help someone evaluate it. Do not state whether the claim is true or false — focus on HOW someone could check it themselves.
